{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:34 2026-07-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:34 2026-07-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:34 2026-07-04 HKT</p><p>葵涌大窩口邨富榮樓一單位，今（4日）早上8時47分，有保安報案指其中一單位冒煙，消防派出搜救隊到場，火警於早上9時救熄。經初步調查，相信是煲燶食物冒煙，其間毋須疏散，無人受傷。</p><p></p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5cab2be6d972ba045690368f47215e4/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-04_at_09_20_56.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大窩口邨富榮樓一單位冒煙。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e816abbff63f05d6321153c5553936ce/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-04_at_09_20_55_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員救火後收隊。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f8f0613f13c52762d278b851e7777cb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-04_at_09_20_55_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a0924d02551d70a8b96fa8a67bcc921a/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-04_at_09_20_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/da2472250081ac29db829176f95e9e2e/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-04_at_09_20_55.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n<p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-04T02:59:19.074092+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}